 "exercises": [
  {
   "id": "ex-rinf",
   "source_id": "it is a good exercize to know how to derive an expression for it from basic principles",
   "kind": "exercise",
   "bloom": "Apply",
   "place": {
    "at": "inline",
    "after": "rinf-invitation"
   },
   "cite": "estimate",
   "prompt": "从基本原理出发，推导里德伯常量$R_\\infty$的表达式。",
   "answer": {
    "type": "open",
    "generated_by": "source",
    "solution": "$$E_0 = -R_\\infty \\sim -\\frac{me^4}{2\\hbar^2}$$ 在基态中把海森伯不等式取为等式，$\\Delta p \\cdot \\Delta r \\sim \\hbar$，平均能量为$E = \\frac{\\hbar^2}{2m\\Delta r^2} - \\frac{e^2}{\\Delta r}$；对$\\Delta r$求其极小值，得到$\\Delta r \\sim \\frac{\\hbar^2}{me^2}$以及上面的基态能量，对于无穷重的原子核，这个结果是精确的。"
   }
  }
 ],
